Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"aurora__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudWatch（Database Insights）、Performance Insights（7 天保留免费，超期按 vCPU 收费）、Enhanced Monitoring（走 CloudWatch Logs 计费）、慢查询日志（要手动在参数组开启并导出，产生日志费用）、DevOps Guru for RDS。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudWatch（Database Insights）、Performance Insights（7 天保留免费，超期按 vCPU 收费）、Enhanced Monitoring（走 CloudWatch Logs 计费）、慢查询日志（要手动在参数组开启并导出，产生日志费用）、DevOps Guru for RDS。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudWatch (Database Insights), Performance Insights (7-day retention free, beyond that billed per vCPU), Enhanced Monitoring (billed via Cloud…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudWatch (Database Insights), Performance Insights (7-day retention free, beyond that billed per vCPU), Enhanced Monitoring (billed via CloudWatch Logs), slow query logs (must be manually enabled in the parameter group and exported, incurring log charges), DevOps Guru for RDS.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">每连接一个后端进程</span><p class=\"snippet\">每连接一个后端进程（MySQL 线程 / PG 进程），连接风暴靠 RDS Proxy 解<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>：托管连接池、IAM 认证、Secrets Manager、failover 感知（不靠 DNS）。reader endpoint 是 DNS 轮询（TTL 5 秒），不是真负载均衡——长连接池不回收会钉死在个别 reader 上。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>每连接一个后端进程（MySQL 线程 / PG 进程），连接风暴靠 <strong>RDS Proxy</strong> 解<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>：托管连接池、IAM 认证、Secrets Manager、failover 感知（不靠 DNS）。reader endpoint 是 DNS 轮询（TTL 5 秒），<strong>不是真负载均衡</strong>——长连接池不回收会钉死在个别 reader 上。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">One backend proces</span><p class=\"snippet\">One backend process per connection (MySQL thread / PG process); connection storms are handled by RDS Proxy <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>: managed connection pooling, IAM authentication…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>One backend process per connection (MySQL thread / PG process); connection storms are handled by <strong>RDS Proxy</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>: managed connection pooling, IAM authentication, Secrets Manager, failover-aware (not DNS-based). The reader endpoint is DNS round-robin (TTL 5 seconds), <strong>not true load balancing</strong> — connection pools that never recycle connections will pin to individual readers.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">继承引擎<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></span><p class=\"snippet\">继承引擎<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。MySQL：InnoDB，默认 REPEATABLE READ；PG：默认 READ COMMITTED，支持 SERIALIZABLE。写转发下 MySQL 仅支持 REPEATABLE READ；Limitless 跨分片事务有限制；XA 支持（PG 需 max_prepared_transactions &gt; 0…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>继承引擎</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。MySQL：InnoDB，默认 REPEATABLE READ；PG：默认 READ COMMITTED，支持 SERIALIZABLE。写转发下 MySQL 仅支持 REPEATABLE READ；Limitless 跨分片事务有限制；XA 支持（PG 需 <code>max_prepared_transactions &gt; 0</code>）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Inherited from the</span><p class=\"snippet\">Inherited from the engine <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. MySQL: InnoDB, default REPEATABLE READ; PG: default READ COMMITTED, SERIALIZABLE supported. Under write forwarding, MySQL suppo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Inherited from the engine</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. MySQL: InnoDB, default REPEATABLE READ; PG: default READ COMMITTED, SERIALIZABLE supported. Under write forwarding, MySQL supports only REPEATABLE READ; Limitless cross-shard transactions have restrictions; XA supported (PG requires <code>max_prepared_transactions &gt; 0</code>).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有，架构核心</span><p class=\"snippet\">有，架构核心（官方论文 + 官方文档）。存储层 6 副本跨 3 AZ，写 quorum 4/6、读 quorum 3/6；计算层只向存储层发 redo 日志（&quot;log is the database&quot;）；reader 共享同一存储卷，复制延迟为毫秒级<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；Global Database 跨 Region 存储层异步物理复制（厂商口…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有，架构核心</strong>（官方论文 + 官方文档）。存储层 6 副本跨 3 AZ，写 quorum 4/6、读 quorum 3/6；计算层只向存储层发 redo 日志（&quot;log is the database&quot;）；reader 共享同一存储卷，复制延迟为毫秒级<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；Global Database 跨 Region 存储层异步物理复制（厂商口径典型 &lt;1 秒）；MySQL 另有 binlog / Enhanced Binlog 逻辑复制选项。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported, architectural core (official paper + official docs). Storage layer: 6 copies across 3 AZs, write quorum 4/6, read quorum 3/6; the compute layer only sends redo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported, architectural core</strong> (official paper + official docs). Storage layer: 6 copies across 3 AZs, write quorum 4/6, read quorum 3/6; the compute layer only sends redo logs to the storage layer (&quot;log is the database&quot;); readers share the same storage volume, replication lag in milliseconds <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>; Global Database: cross-Region asynchronous physical replication at the storage layer (vendor claim: typically &lt;1 second); MySQL additionally offers binlog / Enhanced Binlog logical replication options.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">纵向</span><p class=\"snippet\">纵向（实例规格；Serverless v2 0~256 ACU 自动）+ 横向读扩展（最多 15 副本）+ 存储自动扩容（10GB→256 TiB，只增不减）。写扩展靠 Aurora PostgreSQL Limitless（分片架构，router/shard 两层）。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>纵向（实例规格；Serverless v2 0~256 ACU 自动）+ 横向读扩展（最多 15 副本）+ 存储自动扩容（10GB→256 TiB，<strong>只增不减</strong>）。写扩展靠 Aurora PostgreSQL Limitless（分片架构，router/shard 两层）。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Vertical</span><p class=\"snippet\">Vertical (instance classes; Serverless v2 0–256 ACU automatic) + horizontal read scale-out (up to 15 replicas) + automatic storage expansion (10GB → 256 TiB, grow-only). …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Vertical (instance classes; Serverless v2 0–256 ACU automatic) + horizontal read scale-out (up to 15 replicas) + automatic storage expansion (10GB → 256 TiB, <strong>grow-only</strong>). Write scale-out via Aurora PostgreSQL Limitless (sharded architecture, router/shard two-tier). <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">默认由 Google 管理密钥加密全部数据；支持客户管理密钥（CMEK），密钥存客户自己的 Cloud KMS 官方文档。 注意：CMEK 是高阶版本（Enterprise Plus 等）能力，Standard 版不可用，选型时看版本矩阵 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>默认由 Google 管理密钥加密全部数据；支持客户管理密钥（CMEK），密钥存客户自己的 Cloud KMS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：CMEK 是高阶版本（Enterprise Plus 等）能力，Standard 版不可用，选型时看版本矩阵 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Google-managed keys by default + CMEK). Encrypted by Google-managed keys by default; customer-managed encryption keys (CMEK) with keys in the customer&#x27;s own Cl…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Google-managed keys by default + CMEK).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Encrypted by Google-managed keys by default; customer-managed encryption keys (CMEK) with keys in the customer&#x27;s own Cloud KMS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: CMEK is a higher-tier (Enterprise Plus-class) capability — unavailable on Standard; check the edition matrix during selection <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（TLS 全链路）</span><p class=\"snippet\">所有 API/控制台/驱动流量走 TLS；VPC-SC（VPC Service Controls）可做私有边界隔离 官方文档。 无明文回退：Serverless 架构下不存在自建式明文端口问题 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>所有 API/控制台/驱动流量走 TLS；VPC-SC（VPC Service Controls）可做私有边界隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无明文回退：Serverless 架构下不存在自建式明文端口问题 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (TLS end to end). All API/console/driver traffic over TLS; VPC Service Controls available for private-boundary isolation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No plaintext fallback:…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (TLS end to end).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>All API/console/driver traffic over TLS; VPC Service Controls available for private-boundary isolation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No plaintext fallback: the serverless architecture has no self-managed-style plaintext-port trap <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（GoogleSQL + 迁移服务）</span><p class=\"snippet\">GoogleSQL 方言（源自 ZetaSQL），标准分析 SQL 模式（窗口函数、CTE、数组/结构体）完备 官方文档。 BigQuery Migration Service：Teradata/Oracle/Redshift/Snowflake 的迁移评估与 SQL 翻译 官方文档。 注意：方言与 PG/Oracle 有差异，迁移要改写…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>GoogleSQL 方言（源自 ZetaSQL），标准分析 SQL 模式（窗口函数、CTE、数组/结构体）完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>BigQuery Migration Service：Teradata/Oracle/Redshift/Snowflake 的迁移评估与 SQL 翻译 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：方言与 PG/Oracle 有差异，迁移要改写；&quot;SQL 像&quot;不等于&quot;零改写&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (GoogleSQL + migration service). GoogleSQL dialect (from ZetaSQL) with complete analytical SQL patterns (window functions, CTEs, arrays/structs) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (GoogleSQL + migration service).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GoogleSQL dialect (from ZetaSQL) with complete analytical SQL patterns (window functions, CTEs, arrays/structs) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>BigQuery Migration Service: assessment and SQL translation for Teradata/Oracle/Redshift/Snowflake migrations <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: the dialect differs from PG/Oracle — migrations need rewriting; &quot;SQL-like&quot; ≠ &quot;zero-rewrite&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">纯 GCP 商业服务，无开源/自建版本 官方文档。 计费模型（只写计量边界）：按需按扫描 TiB（每月首 1 TiB 免费，单查询 10 MB 起步）；Editions 按 slot 小时（三档费率，支持 1/3 年承诺折扣）；存储分 active/long-term（90 天未改动自动降档）；BI Engine、Omni、流式写入、ML…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>纯 GCP 商业服务，无开源/自建版本 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计费模型（只写计量边界）：按需按扫描 TiB（每月首 1 TiB 免费，单查询 10 MB 起步）；Editions 按 slot 小时（三档费率，支持 1/3 年承诺折扣）；存储分 active/long-term（90 天未改动自动降档）；BI Engine、Omni、流式写入、ML 训练另计 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>选型铁律：波动/低频负载用按需，稳态/高频用 slot；但 Editions 自动扩缩按分配计费，短查询多的场景可能反而不如按需——POC 必须按真实 workload 测两种账 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (proprietary; per-scan / per-slot dual mode). Pure GCP commercial service — no open-source or self-hosted edition <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Metering boundaries only: on-…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (proprietary; per-scan / per-slot dual mode).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pure GCP commercial service — no open-source or self-hosted edition <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Metering boundaries only: on-demand per scanned TiB (first 1 TiB/month free, 10 MB minimum per query); Editions per slot-hour (three rate tiers with 1/3-year commitment discounts); storage split active/long-term (auto-downgrade after 90 days unmodified); BI Engine, Omni, streaming inserts and ML training billed separately <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Iron rule of selection: spiky/low-frequency loads go on-demand, steady/high-frequency go slots — but Editions autoscaling bills on allocation, so slot-heavy short-query shapes can cost <em>more</em> than on-demand. POCs must meter both bills against real workloads <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（官方有中文，社区偏少）</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方文档有中文版，核心概念与计费文档均已汉化 官方文档。 中文社区内容（博客、课程）明显少于 AWS 系；深度调优与 slot 治理的实战内容英文为主 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>官方文档有中文版，核心概念与计费文档均已汉化 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>中文社区内容（博客、课程）明显少于 AWS 系；深度调优与 slot 治理的实战内容英文为主 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (official Chinese docs, thin community). Official docs available in Chinese, including core concepts and pricing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Chinese community co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (official Chinese docs, thin community).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official docs available in Chinese, including core concepts and pricing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Chinese community content (blogs, courses) is notably thinner than the AWS ecosystem; deep tuning and slot-governance practice is English-first <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Capacitor 列式存储 + Dremel 执行树，PB 级聚合秒到分钟级是常态 官方文档。 BI Engine 内存加速：仪表盘类查询亚秒返回 官方文档。 边界：slot 不足会排队（看 JOBS 视图的等待时间）；冷查询首次执行、跨区/Omni 查询有额外延迟；毫秒级点查不是目标 社区共识。 分区表 + 聚簇是性能与成本的双关键：…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Capacitor 列式存储 + Dremel 执行树，PB 级聚合秒到分钟级是常态 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>BI Engine 内存加速：仪表盘类查询亚秒返回 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边界：slot 不足会排队（看 JOBS 视图的等待时间）；冷查询首次执行、跨区/Omni 查询有额外延迟；毫秒级点查不是目标 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>分区表 + 聚簇是性能与成本的双关键：分区裁剪决定扫描量，扫描量决定按需账单 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Dremel columnar + slot parallelism; seconds-scale). Capacitor columnar storage + Dremel execution trees — PB-scale aggregations in seconds to minutes are routi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Dremel columnar + slot parallelism; seconds-scale).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Capacitor columnar storage + Dremel execution trees — PB-scale aggregations in seconds to minutes are routine <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>BI Engine in-memory acceleration: sub-second dashboard queries <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Boundaries: slot starvation queues queries (watch wait time in JOBS views); first-run cold queries and cross-region/Omni queries add latency; millisecond point lookups are not the target <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Partitioned + clustered tables are the twin keys to performance <em>and</em> cost: partition pruning decides bytes scanned, bytes scanned decide the on-demand bill <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">SOC 1/2/3、ISO/IEC 27001、HIPAA、PCI DSS、FedRAMP 等全覆盖 官方文档。 注意：高阶合规能力（CMEK、大范围审计）与 Enterprise Plus 版本绑定，合规选型要连版本一起看 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SOC 1/2/3、ISO/IEC 27001、HIPAA、PCI DSS、FedRAMP 等全覆盖 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：高阶合规能力（CMEK、大范围审计）与 Enterprise Plus 版本绑定，合规选型要连版本一起看 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (SOC / ISO / HIPAA / PCI / FedRAMP suite). SOC 1/2/3, ISO/IEC 27001, HIPAA, PCI DSS, FedRAMP and others <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Caveat: advanced compliance capabilitie…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (SOC / ISO / HIPAA / PCI / FedRAMP suite).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SOC 1/2/3, ISO/IEC 27001, HIPAA, PCI DSS, FedRAMP and others <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: advanced compliance capabilities (CMEK, broad audit) are Enterprise Plus-gated — evaluate the edition together with compliance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">2011 年 GA，十余年生产验证，是 Serverless 数仓的定义者之一 社区共识。 生态：dbt-bigquery 适配器、Looker（Google 收购）/Looker Studio、Vertex AI 联动，GCP 数据栈一体 社区共识。 风险面：Google 产品线调整史（如旧 flat-rate 关停）提醒用户：计费模型…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>2011 年 GA，十余年生产验证，是 Serverless 数仓的定义者之一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>生态：dbt-bigquery 适配器、Looker（Google 收购）/Looker Studio、Vertex AI 联动，GCP 数据栈一体 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>风险面：Google 产品线调整史（如旧 flat-rate 关停）提醒用户：计费模型会变，合同与架构要留余地 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (GA since 2011; a definer of the serverless warehouse). GA 2011 with 10+ years of production validation — one of the definers of the serverless data warehouse (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (GA since 2011; a definer of the serverless warehouse).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GA 2011 with 10+ years of production validation — one of the definers of the serverless data warehouse <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Ecosystem: dbt-bigquery adapter, Looker (Google-acquired)/Looker Studio, Vertex AI linkage — one GCP data stack <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Risk side: Google&#x27;s product-line history (e.g., legacy flat-rate shutdown) is a reminder that billing models change — leave room in contracts and architecture <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（GCP 公开案例）</span><p class=\"snippet\">公开案例包括 Spotify、The New York Times 等（以 Google Cloud 官网最新披露为准）社区共识。 采用模式常见：BigQuery 做核心数仓 + Looker 做 BI + Vertex AI 做 ML，GCP 生态内闭环 社区共识。 具体名单以官网为准，本档案不堆砌 待验证。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>公开案例包括 Spotify、The New York Times 等（以 Google Cloud 官网最新披露为准）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>采用模式常见：BigQuery 做核心数仓 + Looker 做 BI + Vertex AI 做 ML，GCP 生态内闭环 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>具体名单以官网为准，本档案不堆砌 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (public GCP cases). Published cases include Spotify, The New York Times and others (per latest Google Cloud disclosures) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Common pattern: …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (public GCP cases).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Published cases include Spotify, The New York Times and others (per latest Google Cloud disclosures) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Common pattern: BigQuery as core warehouse + Looker BI + Vertex AI for ML, closed loop inside GCP <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Customer lists per Google&#x27;s site; not enumerated here (to be verified).</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">SQL 工作流：Dataform（Google 原生）、dbt-bigquery 适配器 官方文档。 BI/ML：Looker、Vertex AI（BigQuery ML 模型可直接部署调用）官方文档。 IaC：Terraform Google Provider； ingestion 侧 Data Transfer Service、Dat…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SQL 工作流：Dataform（Google 原生）、dbt-bigquery 适配器 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>BI/ML：Looker、Vertex AI（BigQuery ML 模型可直接部署调用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>IaC：Terraform Google Provider； ingestion 侧 Data Transfer Service、Datastream <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Dataform / dbt / Looker / Vertex AI / Terraform). SQL workflows: Dataform (Google-native), dbt-bigquery adapter <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. BI/ML: Looker, Vertex AI (BigQ…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Dataform / dbt / Looker / Vertex AI / Terraform).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SQL workflows: Dataform (Google-native), dbt-bigquery adapter <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>BI/ML: Looker, Vertex AI (BigQuery ML models deployable for direct serving) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>IaC: Terraform Google provider; ingestion-side Data Transfer Service and Datastream <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">零运维是最大卖点：无集群、无节点、无补丁，开箱即查 官方文档。 仅 GCP 部署；BigQuery Omni 是&quot;跨云查询&quot;（引擎去 AWS/Azure 数据处），不是&quot;部署到别云&quot; 官方文档。 注意：Serverless 不等于零账单——slot/扫描/存储照计；&quot;免运维&quot;省的是人力，不是费用 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>零运维是最大卖点：无集群、无节点、无补丁，开箱即查 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>仅 GCP 部署；BigQuery Omni 是&quot;跨云查询&quot;（引擎去 AWS/Azure 数据处），不是&quot;部署到别云&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：Serverless 不等于零账单——slot/扫描/存储照计；&quot;免运维&quot;省的是人力，不是费用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (pure serverless; GCP only). Zero ops is the headline selling point: no clusters, no nodes, no patching — query out of the box <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. GCP deployment o…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (pure serverless; GCP only).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Zero ops is the headline selling point: no clusters, no nodes, no patching — query out of the box <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>GCP deployment only; BigQuery Omni is &quot;cross-cloud querying&quot; (the engine goes to AWS/Azure data), not &quot;deploy to other clouds&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: serverless ≠ zero bill — slots/scans/storage all meter; &quot;no ops&quot; saves headcount, not spend <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">批量加载（Load Job）免费：GCS/本地文件批量入表不收计算费 官方文档。 Storage Write API 流式写入（每月有免费额度），exactly-once 语义；旧版 streaming insert 按量计费 官方文档。 Datastream：从 MySQL/PostgreSQL/Oracle CDC 近实时同步到 Bi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>批量加载（Load Job）免费：GCS/本地文件批量入表不收计算费 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Storage Write API 流式写入（每月有免费额度），exactly-once 语义；旧版 streaming insert 按量计费 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Datastream：从 MySQL/PostgreSQL/Oracle CDC 近实时同步到 BigQuery，是官方 CDC 入仓通道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Data Transfer Service：定时从 SaaS/其他云/应用导入 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘：流式写入的去重与延迟语义要显式设计；CDC 链路延迟分钟级 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (free batch loads + streaming API + Datastream CDC). Batch loads (load jobs) are free: bulk GCS/local-file ingestion costs no compute <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Storage W…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (free batch loads + streaming API + Datastream CDC).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Batch loads (load jobs) are free: bulk GCS/local-file ingestion costs no compute <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Storage Write API streaming ingestion (monthly free quota) with exactly-once semantics; legacy streaming inserts metered separately <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Datastream: near-real-time CDC from MySQL/PostgreSQL/Oracle into BigQuery — the official CDC ingestion channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Data Transfer Service: scheduled imports from SaaS/other clouds/applications <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Edge: streaming dedup and latency semantics need explicit design; CDC pipelines run at minute-level latency <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（Cloud Audit Logs）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cloud Audit Logs 记录数据访问与管理操作，可经 Log Router 接入 SIEM 官方文档。 INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS 系列视图可查作业历史、执行者、扫描字节与 slot 消耗，是&quot;谁跑了什么查询、花了多少钱&quot;的主入口 官方文档。 注意：审计日志保留与导出要自己配，长期保留有存储成本 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cloud Audit Logs 记录数据访问与管理操作，可经 Log Router 接入 SIEM <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS 系列视图可查作业历史、执行者、扫描字节与 slot 消耗，是&quot;谁跑了什么查询、花了多少钱&quot;的主入口 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：审计日志保留与导出要自己配，长期保留有存储成本 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Cloud Audit Logs). Cloud Audit Logs capture data-access and admin operations, routable via Log Router into a SIEM <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS* vie…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Cloud Audit Logs).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cloud Audit Logs capture data-access and admin operations, routable via Log Router into a SIEM <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li><code>INFORMATION_SCHEMA.JOBS*</code> views expose job history, principals, bytes scanned and slot consumption — the primary &quot;who ran what, what did it cost&quot; surface <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: audit-log retention and export are yours to configure; long retention has storage cost <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">BigQuery Omni：在 AWS/Azure 上运行 BQ 引擎，直接查当地 S3/Blob 数据，免搬迁；支持跨云 join 与跨云物化视图 官方文档。 外部表/对象表：直查 GCS/S3/Azure 数据；BigLake 统一湖仓表格式与治理 官方文档。 新方向：cross-cloud connections（Preview）：…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>BigQuery Omni：在 AWS/Azure 上运行 BQ 引擎，直接查当地 S3/Blob 数据，免搬迁；支持跨云 join 与跨云物化视图 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>外部表/对象表：直查 GCS/S3/Azure 数据；BigLake 统一湖仓表格式与治理 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>新方向：cross-cloud connections（Preview）：从任意 BQ 区域直查 AWS/Azure/Salesforce，据称比 Omni 更省——Preview 状态，生产选型先观望 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>边界：Omni 查询按扫描加价 + 跨云传输费；大数据量反复查仍建议入 BQ 存储；&quot;跨云查询&quot;不等于&quot;跨云免费&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Omni cross-cloud + external tables + BigLake). BigQuery Omni: run the BQ engine on AWS/Azure, querying S3/Blob data in place with no relocation; cross-cloud jo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Omni cross-cloud + external tables + BigLake).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>BigQuery Omni: run the BQ engine on AWS/Azure, querying S3/Blob data in place with no relocation; cross-cloud joins and cross-cloud materialized views supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>External/object tables query GCS/S3/Azure data directly; BigLake unifies lakehouse formats and governance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>New direction: cross-cloud connections (Preview) — query AWS/Azure/Salesforce from any BQ region, claimed cheaper than Omni. Preview status: watch before betting production on it <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Boundaries: Omni queries carry a scan premium plus cross-cloud transfer fees; repeatedly scanned large datasets still belong in BQ storage; &quot;cross-cloud querying&quot; ≠ &quot;cross-cloud free&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">入：Datastream 从 MySQL/PG/Oracle CDC 近实时同步，是官方推荐链路 官方文档。 出：EXPORT 到 GCS、Analytics Hub 跨组织共享、Dataflow 下游消费 官方文档。 无 Snowflake Streams 式原生变更流：下游要&quot;增量跟&quot;，靠时间旅行窗口内的变更比对或导出 CDC，语义弱…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>入：Datastream 从 MySQL/PG/Oracle CDC 近实时同步，是官方推荐链路 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>出：EXPORT 到 GCS、Analytics Hub 跨组织共享、Dataflow 下游消费 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 Snowflake Streams 式原生变更流：下游要&quot;增量跟&quot;，靠时间旅行窗口内的变更比对或导出 CDC，语义弱一档 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Datastream in; export/sharing out). In: Datastream CDC from MySQL/PG/Oracle in near real time — the officially recommended path <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Out: EXPORT to…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Datastream in; export/sharing out).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In: Datastream CDC from MySQL/PG/Oracle in near real time — the officially recommended path <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Out: EXPORT to GCS, cross-organization sharing via Analytics Hub, Dataflow for downstream consumption <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No Snowflake-Streams-style native change feed: downstream &quot;incremental follow&quot; relies on in-window change comparison via time travel or CDC exports — a weaker semantic tier <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（表/分区过期时间原生）</span><p class=\"snippet\">表级 expiration_time、数据集默认过期、分区表 partition_expiration_days 官方文档。 过期自动删且不收删除费，是成本治理常用手段 官方文档。 过期是整表/整分区粒度，无行级 TTL 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>表级 expiration_time、数据集默认过期、分区表 partition_expiration_days <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>过期自动删且不收删除费，是成本治理常用手段 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>过期是整表/整分区粒度，无行级 TTL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native table/partition expiration; partition_expiration_days). Table expiration_time, dataset default expiration, partition_expiration_days <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Ex…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native table/partition expiration; partition_expiration_days).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Table expiration_time, dataset default expiration, partition_expiration_days <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Expiry auto-deletes at no deletion cost — a standard cost-governance lever <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Expiry is table-/partition-granular; no row-level TTL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（加列/放宽模式在线）</span><p class=\"snippet\">加列、放宽 required-&gt;nullable 等是在线元数据操作 官方文档。 列改名/改类型支持有限，部分需重建表 官方文档。 分区/聚簇变更代价高，建表时一次定好 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>加列、放宽 required-&gt;nullable 等是在线元数据操作 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>列改名/改类型支持有限，部分需重建表 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>分区/聚簇变更代价高，建表时一次定好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Online add-column / schema relaxation). Add-column and relaxation (required→nullable) are online metadata ops <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Renames / type changes are limit…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Online add-column / schema relaxation).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add-column and relaxation (required→nullable) are online metadata ops <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Renames / type changes are limited; some need table rebuilds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Partitioning/clustering changes are costly — get them right at creation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">预留 slot 按项目/团队分配，互不抢占 官方文档。 按需模式靠配额限流，隔离弱于预留 官方文档。 成本归因到项目标签，FinOps 友好 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>预留 slot 按项目/团队分配，互不抢占 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>按需模式靠配额限流，隔离弱于预留 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>成本归因到项目标签，FinOps 友好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Slot reservations/assignments; compute isolation). Reserved slots assigned per project/team with no preemption <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. On-demand mode relies on quota …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Slot reservations/assignments; compute isolation).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reserved slots assigned per project/team with no preemption <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>On-demand mode relies on quota throttling — weaker isolation than reservations <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cost attribution via project labels is FinOps-friendly <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">数据集跨区复制（BigQuery 跨区域复制）做容灾/就近读 官方文档。 写仍是单区语义，无多活写 官方文档。 复制产生额外存储+作业费用 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>数据集跨区复制（BigQuery 跨区域复制）做容灾/就近读 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>写仍是单区语义，无多活写 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>复制产生额外存储+作业费用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cross-region dataset copy; single-region writes). Cross-region dataset copy for DR / local reads <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Writes stay single-region; no active-active wri…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cross-region dataset copy; single-region writes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cross-region dataset copy for DR / local reads <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Writes stay single-region; no active-active writes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Copies incur extra storage + job costs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（托管多区，用户无感知）</span><p class=\"snippet\">计算存储全托管多区复制，故障平台兜底 官方文档。 时间旅行 7 天可恢复误删，用户侧 RPO≈0 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>计算存储全托管多区复制，故障平台兜底 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>时间旅行 7 天可恢复误删，用户侧 RPO≈0 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Managed multi-zone; invisible to users). Fully managed multi-zone compute/storage replication; the platform absorbs failures <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 7-day time travel…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Managed multi-zone; invisible to users).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fully managed multi-zone compute/storage replication; the platform absorbs failures <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>7-day time travel recovers accidental deletes; user-side RPO≈0 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">BigQuery 提供 Row-level security（行级访问策略）与基于 Policy Tags 的列级动态脱敏（DLP 集成） 官方文档 列级权限通过 Policy Tags + IAM Data Catalog 实现 官方文档 脱敏策略依赖 Cloud DLP，跨项目配置复杂度高 社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>BigQuery 提供 Row-level security（行级访问策略）与基于 Policy Tags 的列级动态脱敏（DLP 集成） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>列级权限通过 Policy Tags + IAM Data Catalog 实现 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>脱敏策略依赖 Cloud DLP，跨项目配置复杂度高 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Row-level security + Policy Tags masking). BigQuery provides row-level security and Policy Tags-based column-level dynamic masking (DLP integration) (official …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Row-level security + Policy Tags masking).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>BigQuery provides row-level security and Policy Tags-based column-level dynamic masking (DLP integration) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Column privileges via Policy Tags plus IAM Data Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Masking policies depend on Cloud DLP; cross-project configuration is complex <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（JSON 类型原生，函数丰富）</span><p class=\"snippet\">原生 JSON 数据类型，JSON_QUERY/JSON_VALUE 等函数丰富 官方文档。 按扫描计费，SELECT * 大 JSON 费用惊人 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>原生 JSON 数据类型，JSON_QUERY/JSON_VALUE 等函数丰富 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>按扫描计费，SELECT * 大 JSON 费用惊人 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native JSON, rich functions). Native JSON type with rich JSON_QUERY/JSON_VALUE functions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Billed per scanned byte; SELECT * on big JSON is shoc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native JSON, rich functions).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Native JSON type with rich JSON_QUERY/JSON_VALUE functions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Billed per scanned byte; SELECT * on big JSON is shockingly expensive <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">SEARCH 函数与 search index 支持全文检索 官方文档。 索引有配额与延迟，非实时 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SEARCH 函数与 search index 支持全文检索 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>索引有配额与延迟，非实时 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (SEARCH functions + search index). SEARCH functions and search index for full-text <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Index has quotas and lag; not real-time <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (SEARCH functions + search index).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SEARCH functions and search index for full-text <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Index has quotas and lag; not real-time <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（IAM + 列级/行级 + 脱敏）</span><p class=\"snippet\">身份：GCP IAM 统一身份体系，支持 Google Workspace/Cloud Identity SSO 官方文档。 授权：数据集/表/视图级 IAM；列级访问控制、行级安全（row-level security）、数据脱敏策略（data masking）官方文档。 政策标签（Policy Tags）做数据分类分级，是金融/医疗合…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>身份：GCP IAM 统一身份体系，支持 Google Workspace/Cloud Identity SSO <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>授权：数据集/表/视图级 IAM；列级访问控制、行级安全（row-level security）、数据脱敏策略（data masking）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>政策标签（Policy Tags）做数据分类分级，是金融/医疗合规的常用姿势 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：高阶治理能力（列级安全、CMEK）与版本绑定，Standard 版有功能天花板 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (IAM + column/row-level + masking). Identity: unified GCP IAM identity, Google Workspace/Cloud Identity SSO supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Authorization: dataset/ta…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (IAM + column/row-level + masking).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Identity: unified GCP IAM identity, Google Workspace/Cloud Identity SSO supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Authorization: dataset/table/view-level IAM; column-level access control, row-level security, data masking policies <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Policy Tags for data classification — the standard posture for finance/healthcare compliance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: advanced governance (column-level security, CMEK) is edition-gated — Standard has a feature ceiling <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">底层 Capacitor 列式存储格式，自动压缩与编码，用户按压缩后用量计费。官方文档 长周期存储自动转入低成本层级，压缩与分层共同降低账单。官方文档 压缩为平台黑盒，无用户可调参数，压缩比不公开披露。待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>底层 Capacitor 列式存储格式，自动压缩与编码，用户按压缩后用量计费。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>长周期存储自动转入低成本层级，压缩与分层共同降低账单。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>压缩为平台黑盒，无用户可调参数，压缩比不公开披露。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Capacitor columnar with automatic compression). The underlying Capacitor columnar format compresses and encodes automatically; users are billed on post-compres…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Capacitor columnar with automatic compression).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The underlying Capacitor columnar format compresses and encodes automatically; users are billed on post-compression usage. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Long-term storage automatically tiers to lower-cost classes; compression plus tiering lowers bills. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Compression is a platform black box with no user tunables and undisclosed ratios. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Google BigQuery 是 GCP 专属的 serverless 数仓，无开源版本，完全绑定 Google Cloud。官方文档 Standard SQL 方言与 BQ 特有函数（ML、GIS、半结构化）深度绑定平台。社区共识 数据以 Capacitor 列存格式存储，迁出需导出转换，超大表成本高昂。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Google BigQuery 是 GCP 专属的 serverless 数仓，无开源版本，完全绑定 Google Cloud。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Standard SQL 方言与 BQ 特有函数（ML、GIS、半结构化）深度绑定平台。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>数据以 Capacitor 列存格式存储，迁出需导出转换，超大表成本高昂。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Google Cloud exclusive; no open-source edition). Google BigQuery is a GCP-exclusive serverless warehouse with no open-source edition, fully bound to Google Clo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Google Cloud exclusive; no open-source edition).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Google BigQuery is a GCP-exclusive serverless warehouse with no open-source edition, fully bound to Google Cloud. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Its Standard SQL dialect and BQ-specific functions (ML, GIS, semi-structured) bind deeply to the platform. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Data is stored in the Capacitor columnar format; migration requires export conversion, expensive for very large tables. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Dremel 架构 CBO 全自动优化，EXPLAIN 可用 官方文档。 无 hint 机制，用户不干预计划 官方文档。 slot 自动调度使计划翻转风险极低 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Dremel 架构 CBO 全自动优化，EXPLAIN 可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 hint 机制，用户不干预计划 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>slot 自动调度使计划翻转风险极低 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Fully automatic Dremel CBO; no hints). Dremel-architecture CBO fully automatic; EXPLAIN available <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No hint mechanism; users don&#x27;t steer plans (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Fully automatic Dremel CBO; no hints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dremel-architecture CBO fully automatic; EXPLAIN available <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No hint mechanism; users don&#x27;t steer plans <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Automatic slot scheduling makes plan flips extremely rare <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Serverless 模式零参数，autoscaling 自动扩缩 slot 官方文档。 调优转为 SQL 改写与成本（slot/字节计费）管理 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Serverless 模式零参数，autoscaling 自动扩缩 slot <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>调优转为 SQL 改写与成本（slot/字节计费）管理 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Serverless zero-knob autonomy benchmark). Serverless mode has zero knobs; autoscaling scales slots automatically <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Tuning becomes SQL rewriting …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Serverless zero-knob autonomy benchmark).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Serverless mode has zero knobs; autoscaling scales slots automatically <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Tuning becomes SQL rewriting plus cost (slot/byte billing) management <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">数据文件落 Colossus 分布式文件系统，底层校验、纠删码与冗余由 Google 内部完成。厂商口径 用户侧无页校验开关、校验命令或损坏审计视图。社区共识 时间旅行与快照防的是逻辑损坏，静默位损坏不在用户可观测范围。官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>数据文件落 Colossus 分布式文件系统，底层校验、纠删码与冗余由 Google 内部完成。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>用户侧无页校验开关、校验命令或损坏审计视图。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>时间旅行与快照防的是逻辑损坏，静默位损坏不在用户可观测范围。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Colossus checks underneath; no switch). Data files sit on the Colossus distributed file system; checks, erasure coding, and redundancy are handled internally by …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Colossus checks underneath; no switch).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data files sit on the Colossus distributed file system; checks, erasure coding, and redundancy are handled internally by Google. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>No user-facing checksum switch, verification command, or corruption audit view. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Time travel and snapshots guard against logical corruption; silent bit-rot is outside user observability. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（SQL 脚本/存储过程+调度查询）</span><p class=\"snippet\">多语句脚本、存储过程（procedures），scheduled queries 定时调度 官方文档。 去 O 迁移 PL/SQL 需改写 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>多语句脚本、存储过程（procedures），scheduled queries 定时调度 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>去 O 迁移 PL/SQL 需改写 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Scripting/procedures/scheduling). Multi-statement scripting, procedures, scheduled queries <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Oracle PL/SQL needs rewrites <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Scripting/procedures/scheduling).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multi-statement scripting, procedures, scheduled queries <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Oracle PL/SQL needs rewrites <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（PK/FK 信息性不强制）</span><p class=\"snippet\">主键/外键为 not enforced 信息性约束 官方文档。 靠上游保证，错误声明影响优化 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>主键/外键为 not enforced 信息性约束 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>靠上游保证，错误声明影响优化 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Informational PK/FK). PK/FK not enforced, informational <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Guaranteed upstream; wrong declarations affect optimization <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Informational PK/FK).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PK/FK not enforced, informational <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Guaranteed upstream; wrong declarations affect optimization <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（分析 SQL 强项，函数极全）</span><p class=\"snippet\">窗口函数、CTE、PIVOT、ML 函数，分析 SQL 为强项 官方文档。 方言（GoogleSQL）与标准 SQL 差异，迁移注意 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>窗口函数、CTE、PIVOT、ML 函数，分析 SQL 为强项 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>方言（GoogleSQL）与标准 SQL 差异，迁移注意 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Analytical SQL strength). Window functions, CTEs, PIVOT, ML functions — analytical SQL is its strength <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. GoogleSQL dialect differs from standard…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Analytical SQL strength).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Window functions, CTEs, PIVOT, ML functions — analytical SQL is its strength <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>GoogleSQL dialect differs from standard SQL <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">删除靠 DML DELETE，无原生擦除工作流 官方文档 Time travel（7 天）与快照使被删数据在窗口期内可恢复 官方文档 长期备份与导出表延长残留面 社区共识 无擦除证明 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>删除靠 DML DELETE，无原生擦除工作流 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Time travel（7 天）与快照使被删数据在窗口期内可恢复 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>长期备份与导出表延长残留面 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>无擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (DML deletes; time travel window residue). Deletion is DML DELETE; no native erasure workflow <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Time travel (7 days) and snapshots keep deleted data…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (DML deletes; time travel window residue).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deletion is DML DELETE; no native erasure workflow <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Time travel (7 days) and snapshots keep deleted data recoverable inside the window <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Long-term backups and exported tables extend the residue surface <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>No erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Dataplex 自动采集列级血缘，Data Catalog 统一发现 官方文档。 血缘覆盖查询/作业全链路 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Dataplex 自动采集列级血缘，Data Catalog 统一发现 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>血缘覆盖查询/作业全链路 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Dataplex column-level lineage + Catalog; benchmark). Dataplex auto-captures column-level lineage; Data Catalog unifies discovery <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Lineage spans…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Dataplex column-level lineage + Catalog; benchmark).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dataplex auto-captures column-level lineage; Data Catalog unifies discovery <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Lineage spans queries and jobs end to end <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">时间旅行：默认 7 天，可查询表的历史版本、恢复误删数据 官方文档。 故障安全期（fail-safe）：时间旅行窗口之外再加 7 天（Google 侧保留，需走支持恢复）官方文档。 表快照、数据集复制、跨区域数据集复制做容灾与归档 官方文档。 注意：7 天窗口比 Snowflake（企业版 90 天）短得多，长期审计/合规归档要靠快照或导…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>时间旅行：默认 7 天，可查询表的历史版本、恢复误删数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>故障安全期（fail-safe）：时间旅行窗口之外再加 7 天（Google 侧保留，需走支持恢复）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>表快照、数据集复制、跨区域数据集复制做容灾与归档 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：7 天窗口比 Snowflake（企业版 90 天）短得多，长期审计/合规归档要靠快照或导出到 GCS，不能依赖时间旅行 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (7-day time travel + snapshots + cross-region copy). Time travel: 7 days by default — query historical table versions, recover from accidental deletes (official…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (7-day time travel + snapshots + cross-region copy).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Time travel: 7 days by default — query historical table versions, recover from accidental deletes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Fail-safe: an additional 7 days beyond the time-travel window (Google-side retention, recovery via support) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Table snapshots, dataset copy and cross-region dataset copy for DR and archiving <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: the 7-day window is far shorter than Snowflake&#x27;s (90 days on Enterprise) — long-horizon audit/compliance archiving must rely on snapshots or GCS exports, not time travel <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Colossus 分布式存储 + Dremel 计算，存算分离的开创者 官方文档。 计算资源按 slot 弹性，与存储完全解耦 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Colossus 分布式存储 + Dremel 计算，存算分离的开创者 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计算资源按 slot 弹性，与存储完全解耦 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Disaggregation pioneer: Colossus + Dremel). Colossus distributed storage + Dremel compute; the disaggregation pioneer <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Compute scales in slots,…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Disaggregation pioneer: Colossus + Dremel).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Colossus distributed storage + Dremel compute; the disaggregation pioneer <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Compute scales in slots, fully decoupled from storage <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">JSON、GEOGRAPHY、BigQuery ML，VECTOR_SEARCH 有限支持 官方文档。 无原生全文/图引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>JSON、GEOGRAPHY、BigQuery ML，VECTOR_SEARCH 有限支持 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生全文/图引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (JSON + GEOGRAPHY + ML; limited vectors). JSON, GEOGRAPHY, BigQuery ML, and limited VECTOR_SEARCH <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native full-text/graph engine (community con…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (JSON + GEOGRAPHY + ML; limited vectors).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON, GEOGRAPHY, BigQuery ML, and limited VECTOR_SEARCH <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native full-text/graph engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "bigquery__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">dry run 可预估查询扫描量再执行，是成本可观测的标杆实践。官方文档 INFORMATION_SCHEMA 按作业/用户归因 slot 与字节用量，custom quotas 限流，预算告警完整。官方文档 账单可导出 BigQuery 做细粒度 FinOps 分析。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>dry run 可预估查询扫描量再执行，是成本可观测的标杆实践。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>INFORMATION_SCHEMA 按作业/用户归因 slot 与字节用量，custom quotas 限流，预算告警完整。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>账单可导出 BigQuery 做细粒度 FinOps 分析。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Benchmark: dry run, quotas, alerts). Dry run estimates bytes scanned before execution: a benchmark FinOps practice. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> INFORMATION_SCHEMA attribut…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Benchmark: dry run, quotas, alerts).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dry run estimates bytes scanned before execution: a benchmark FinOps practice. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>INFORMATION_SCHEMA attributes slot and byte usage by job/user; custom quotas throttle spend, with full budget alerting. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Billing exports to BigQuery for fine-grained FinOps analysis. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});